s=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/statistiki\">← <!-- -->Всички показатели</a></p><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">Жилища</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Не могат да отопляват дома си</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Делът на хората, които казват, че не могат да поддържат жилището си достатъчно топло. Мярка за енергийна бедност.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 mb-10\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">България<!-- -->, <!-- -->2025</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">16,1</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">% от населението</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Промяна спрямо <!-- -->2024</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1 text-[#1f7a4a]\">-2,9</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">в добрата посока</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">ЕС, <!-- -->2025</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">8,8</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">България е над средното за ЕС</p></div></div><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Във времето</h2></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">По-ниската стойност е по-добра за хората.</p></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Какво следва за хората</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Когато расте</p><p class=\"text-[15px]\">Повече енергийна бедност.</p></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Когато пада</p><p class=\"text-[15px]\">По-малко хора живеят на студено.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Свързани показатели</h2></div><ul class=\"grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/statistiki/inflation_energy\">Поскъпване на енергията</a><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\"> · <!-- -->0,6<!-- --> (<!-- -->2025<!-- -->)</span><p class=\"text-[15px] mt-1\">Цените на енергията.</p></li></ul></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Какво се движи заедно с него</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Сравняваме годишните промени, а не самите стойности, за да не излизат връзки само защото всичко расте с времето. Корелацията показва, че две неща се движат заедно. Тя не доказва, че едното причинява другото.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-[15px]\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-sm text-muted\"><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Показател</th><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Посока</th><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Сила</th><th class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">r</th><th class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">Години</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/pm25_deaths\">Преждевременни смъртни случаи от фини прахови частици (PM2.5)</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в обратни посоки</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">умерена</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">-0,65</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2008<!-- -->–<!-- -->2023<!-- --> (<!-- -->16<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/out_of_pocket\">Разходи за здраве от джоба на пациента</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в една посока</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">умерена</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">0,54</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2012<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->13<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/defence_spending\">Държавни разходи за отбрана</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в една посока</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">умерена</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">0,53</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2006<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->19<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/infant_mortality\">Детска смъртност</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в обратни посоки</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">умерена</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">-0,52</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2014<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->11<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/robbery\">Грабежи</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в една посока</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">слаба</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">0,47</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2009<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->16<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/fertility\">Плодовитост</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в обратни посоки</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">слаба</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">-0,46</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2014<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->11<!-- -->)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mb-10\">Източник: Евростат, набор <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/ilc_mdes01/default/table\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ilc_mdes01</a> (<a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/statistics/1.0/data/ilc_mdes01?format=JSON&amp;lang=EN&amp;geo=BG&amp;geo=EU27_2020&amp;geo=RO&amp;geo=GR&amp;geo=HR&amp;geo=PL&amp;geo=HU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">заявката, от която са взети числата</a>).</p><section><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Още в „<!-- -->Жилища<!-- -->“</h2></div><p class=\